  "title": "Made Me Love Pumpkin Cake",
  "description": "Pumpkin is the starring ingredient in this moist sheet cake that&#39;s seasoned with cinnamon, nutmeg, and cloves, and studded with chopped walnuts. Frosted with a cinnamon-cream cheese icing, it&#39;s perfect for any autumn celebration.",
